WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:06.000
The D'Souza Equation, by Thomas D'Souza, Founder, Relevant Search Media.

00:06.000 --> 00:13.000
When your customer has a problem, they ask. They used to ask Google.

00:13.000 --> 00:20.000
Now they also ask Maps, ChatGPT, Gemini and Perplexity. The engines keep changing.

00:20.000 --> 00:28.000
But your customer's question does not. Engines change. The question does not.

00:28.000 --> 00:38.000
Every engine does the same job. It names the business it can read plainly, confirm from other sources, and see real people choose.

00:38.000 --> 00:47.000
That is the D'Souza Equation: Relevance equals Read, times Confirm, times Choose.

00:47.000 --> 00:57.000
The three terms multiply. If any one is zero, the answer is zero.

00:57.000 --> 01:07.000
The industry sells a new service for every new engine. The equation describes the one thing all engines share.

01:07.000 --> 01:15.000
Relevant search. Relevant traffic. Relevant leads. Book a discovery call at relevantsearchmedia.com.
